     ```java
     private boolean isConcatenatedQuery(ASTMethodCall node) {
         return node.getArguments().descendantsOrSelf()
             .filterIs(ASTStringLiteral.class)
             .any(lit -> lit.getContent().contains("'+") 
                 || lit.getContent().contains("+\""));
     }
     ```

